			subtitle: "The last page is a map."
			icon: "valley:letter"
			description: ["Josie: \"If you're reading this I'm dead and the valley is cold. Only one of those is your problem.\"", "", "Take Josie's Letter out of your bag and right-click it. Read all four pages — the last one tells you where the old Kettle farm is.", "", "Forty lamps. Fifteen people. One winter that nobody leaves."]
			x: 0.0d
