		{
			id: "0BFB18E2492D8F4D"
			title: "Fence the Pen and Open the Three Hen Crates"
			subtitle: "Two hens and a rooster."
			icon: "valley:hen_crate"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Two hens and a rooster. Don't name the rooster — you'll get attached, and he is horrible.\"", "", "Put a fence section on each of the 23 stone footings marked out behind the house, hang the gate on the single grey slab in the middle of the side facing you, then right-click all three Hen Crates inside the finished pen. Any order is right.", "", "A nesting box goes down with two eggs already in it, a Megatorch goes up over the coop, and you get chicken feed — right-click a hen with it and she lays."]
			x: 14.0d
			y: -1.5d
