		{
			id: "30B43B34367293CB"
			title: "Take Three Eggs to Marnie"
			subtitle: "Pip is watching the box."
			icon: "minecraft:egg"
			description: ["Pip: \"Is that an egg? Aunt Marnie says I get a duck if I'm useful, so I am being extremely useful.\"", "", "Collect 3 eggs from the nesting box behind your house — right-click a hen with chicken feed if you would rather not wait — and hand them in here. Marnie gets them either way; the book does the walking.", "", "Pip moves in, hands you a Duckling and names it after you before you can stop him. His courier board opens, and Marnie empties her carding basket of 16 wool onto the counter."]
			x: 16.0d
			y: -0.8d
