			title: "Craft 8 Andesite Alloy"
			subtitle: "Eight. Not nine."
			icon: "create:andesite_alloy"
			description: ["Bram: \"One andesite, one iron nugget, pressed. Eight of them, not nine — if you're making nine you've misread something.\"", "", "Craft 8 Andesite Alloy — one andesite and one iron nugget each, so eight andesite and one ingot's worth of nuggets — and hold them when you hand the quest in. The rest of Bram's crate is for the Millstone.", "", "You get a pre-made Mechanical Press, 8 cogwheels, 8 shafts and 32 wheat — the whole bill for the Millstone and its first grind."]
