		{
			id: "FEFC0D973670E744"
			title: "Grind 16 Wheat Flour on a Hand-Cranked Millstone"
			subtitle: "Your arm first, then the river."
			icon: "create:millstone"
			description: ["Bram: \"Hand crank first. You should know exactly what the water is doing for you before it starts doing it.\"", "", "Build a Millstone, put a Hand Crank on top of it, and grind Bram's 32 wheat down to 16 Wheat Flour for Marnie.", "", "Encased Fan, 3 Andesite Alloy, casings and iron — the parts list for the Mechanical Saw in two quests' time."]
