			icon: "valley:seasoned_oak_board"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Green planks want heat and time. Josie dried every board in this valley in a furnace and was insufferable about it.\"", "", "Smelt the 32 Green Oak Planks in any furnace — about two minutes for the lot — and hold 32 Seasoned Oak Boards. Marnie's charcoal is in the barrel by the door.", "", "Bram cannot craft a Water Wheel without these boards — that gate is the furnace, and the furnace is you. You also get the inn's spare crockery, a chair by the fire, and the Counter, Sink and Oven for the kitchen."]
