			icon: "cookingforblockheads:oven"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Counter, sink, oven, along the back wall in that order. I've had the spots chalked for four years.\"", "", "Hold the Kitchen Counter, Sink and Oven when you hand this in — the book counts them and never takes them — then set them on the three marked spots along the inn's back wall — three grey slabs, numbered 1, 2 and 3 on the wall above them: counter, sink, oven, in that order. Cook Bread, a Pumpkin Pie and a Vegetable Soup in that kitchen; everything is in the crate by the counter.", "", "You get the recipe book, the fruit basket, Marnie's cupboards — and Oda's broom off the back door, which Q19 needs."]
