			description: ["Oda: \"Eleven years of keeping the ledger of a shop with nothing in it. Bring me stock and I will open the door.\"", "", "Sweep the marked cobwebs out of the store with Oda's broom, then hand her 16 Wheat Flour and 8 Bread across the counter.", "", "Forty lamps. Fifteen people. One winter that nobody leaves.", "", "The Thaw Fair opens at the Town Anchor: four stalls, a long table, bunting, six lamps burning — and five people standing in a square that was a frozen field in February."]
